<title>USA: U.S. soymeal sales to China 50,000 tonnes w/e Jan2.</title>
<headline>U.S. soymeal sales to China 50,000 tonnes w/e Jan2.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. soybean meal sales to China in the week ending Jan 2 totalled 50,000 tonnes, the Agriculture Department said Thursday in its weekly Export Sales Report.</p>
<p>USDA also said soybean oil sales to China that week totalled 32,000 tonnes.</p>
